          "**use_reversible_instance_norm** – Whether to use reversible instance normalization RINorm against distribution shift as shown in [2]_. It is only applied to the features of the target series and not the covariates. If True, applies RINorm with default hyperparameters. If a dictionary, defines the hyperparameters to construct the RINorm. Supported parameters are {\"affine\": bool, \"eps\": float}. Default: False.",
